#: ../../domain-ldap/nubus-provisioning-service.rst:87
msgid ""
"The *Provisioning Service* delivers a stream of events about data changes"
" in the LDAP directory service. It uses the following components:"
msgstr ""
"Der *Provisioning Service* liefert einen Stream von Ereignissen über "
